    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].texts.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Eledrius... o seom vetheriondre di deluveum.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: This is Vetheriondre... the sealing glyph. It is a holy place. You are
        fortunate to have arrived here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: O seom vetheriondre ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: This node is unique. It is a <color=#FF8CAB>Terminal</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[4]'
      value: Judging by the potency of the Mountain spirit in this place, <color=#FF8CAB>Terminals</color>
        may have some special properties...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[5]'
      value: I sense more of them across the Mountain. If awakened, their secrets
        may be revealed to us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[6]'
      value: I sense more of them across the Mountain. If awakened, their secrets
        may be revealed to us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: This node is unlike the others... it is a <color=#FF8CAB>Terminal</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: <color=#FF8CAB>Terminals</color> were built near sites of great import
        all across the Mountain. Even at at the Summit.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Nodes like these likely have special properties that one of your nature
        could channel.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: If more are awakened, their secrets may be revealed to us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Do you know the mythology of this land?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: '"The Mountain is the veil between life and death. Amadea''s will fell
        from above into the frost below,\na wonderous clash that sculpted the land."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: ...that's it. It's a short myth. Yet in its words, the nature of our
        world is laid clear.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: The very ground is the product of bitter strife. Crafted from an eternal
        war between the most primordial forces in existence.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[4]'
      value: The very ground is the product of bitter strife. Crafted from an eternal
        war between the most primordial forces in existence.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[3].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: With each <color=#FF8CAB>leyline</color> you awaken, I feel greater
        strength.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[3].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: You and I have a large part to play in this world's destiny.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[3].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Forge ahead and seek out more nodes, in hidden crevasses and high peaks.
        Each one will be a test.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[3].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: Good luck.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].advanceDialogueIndex
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].advanceDialogueIndex
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].advanceDialogueIndex
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
